<title>USA: U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS - Issues to watch - Dec 3.</title>
<headline>U.S. HEADLINE STOCKS - Issues to watch - Dec 3.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stocks to watch this morning:</p>
<p>* Hutchinson Technology Inc said it expects fiscal first quarter (ending December 29) net sales of $104-$109 million and earnings of $1.50-$1.90 per share. The First Call consensus earnings estimate is $0.71 per share. Hutchinson shares closed at 52-3/4 Monday.</p>
<p>* American Freightways Corp said it will complete the restructuring of its line haul and terminal operations this month and will reduce staffing by about 1,000. Shares closed at 10-5/8.</p>
</text>
